    "seo_title": "Emergency Phone Numbers by Country - Free Download (Excel/CSV/PDF)",
    "seo_description": "Get essential emergency phone numbers for 73 countries worldwide. Free download of police, fire, and ambulance numbers. Available in Excel, CSV, and PDF formats.",
    "title": "Global Emergency Phone Numbers by Country Dataset",
    "description": "This dataset provides a comprehensive list of emergency phone numbers (Police, Fire, Ambulance, General Emergency) for 73 countries globally, along with their ISO codes and specific notes. It's an invaluable resource for travelers, developers, and researchers needing quick access to vital emergency contacts.",
    "key_takeaways": [
      "Access a comprehensive list of emergency service numbers for 73 countries.",
      "Explore direct contacts for Police, Fire, Ambulance, and General emergency lines.",
      "Download vital country-specific emergency data in multiple convenient formats.",
      "Get ISO codes and important notes for each country's emergency services."
    ],
