      "Print the **PDF** version for a tangible, offline reference guide, ideal for travelers, educators, or in emergency preparedness kits where internet access may be limited.",
      "Leverage this dataset to enhance public safety applications, develop travel guides, or support research on global emergency response systems and accessibility."
